    1. Run `1_download_prism.R` to download PRISM climate data\
    2. Run `2_raster_to_polygon.R` to align rasters with county polygons and calculate anomalies\
    3. Run `3_plot_video.R` to generate PNG figures for each year and create GIF animation\
\
* Relationship between files, if important: PRISM and population rasters are processed to generate population-weighted county-level temperature anomalies, which are visualized in the PNG and GIF outputs.\
